STATUS:
======

This software is VERY NEW.  There are bugs and missing features.

INSTALLATION:
============

1. Rename this directory to extensions/WETitle inside your
   MediaWiki directory.
3. Add this line to the end of your LocalSettings.php:
   require_once('extensions/WETitle/WETitle.php');

